" wanderlan  1 Overview  2 Sites  3 VLANs  4 MACs  5 Log  6 Setup  7 Settings    "
"┌ Settings (Enter: change, Up/Down: more) ─────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│  Path MTU check       every 5m                                               │"
"│  TCP MSS              from the path MTU                                      │"
"│  Control port         51821                                                  │"
"│This host                                                                     │"
"│  This site            heim                                                   │"
"│  Trunk                ens19                                                  │"
"│Role and rights        who may change VLANs: Sites (2), Enter, Changes        │"
"│  Role                 server (connected with the other servers)              │"
"│  Clients              haus6                                                  │"
"│  Managed by           - (not managed by another site)                        │"
"│  Manages              -                                                      │"
"│Trunk per tunnel       this host only; another trunk = own segment            │"
"│  to buero             default (ens19)                                        │"
"│  to haus2             ens20 (own segment wl-ens20)                           │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" The local interface the tunnel to haus2 is bridged with; empty: the default    "
" trunk. Another interface makes it a segment of its own here (bridge            "
" wl-<interface>): only that network reaches haus2.                              "
" Changes go into the draft; a reviews and applies them, c confirms.             "
"                                                                                "
"                                    1 blocked (see 1)  draft: 1 change  heim r7 "
" Enter  change   Up/Down  choose   a  apply   x  discard   ?  help   q  quit    "
